# The image is the source tree — there is no build step — so this file is what
# keeps the image down to the source tree. Tests are excluded because nothing in
# a running service imports them; configuration files are excluded because a
# committed image must never carry a deployment's values (credential-and-secret-
# handling.md AC1).
**/node_modules
.git
.env
.env.*
deploy/secrets
**/*.test.ts
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
docs
specs
scripts
*.md
loop.sh
parse_stream.cjs
